---
import { v2AppsUrl } from "../../../lib/v2Links";
---

<section class="billboard" id="features">
  <img class="bb-art-bg" src="/v2/assets/stamp-art20.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  <div class="wrap bb-grid">
    <div class="bb-head">
      <span class="eyebrow bb-eyebrow"><span>Feature Tour</span></span>
      <h2 class="bb-title">Every tool a solo table needs, in your pocket.</h2>
      <p class="bb-lead">Fate Questions, Meaning Tables, dice, Journals, and Custom Tables stay close while you play.</p>
      <ul class="bb-list">
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Licensed Fate Chart and Meaning Tables</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Scenes, Characters, Threads, and Features</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Custom Tables with import/export</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Saved dice formulas for repeat rolls</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--accent" href={v2AppsUrl}><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i> See the Apps</a>
    </div>
    <div class="bb-viewer" id="bbViewer">
      <div class="bb-slide on" data-orient="tall">
        <div class="bb-slide-phone"><span class="bb-slide-platform">Mobile</span><img src="/v2/assets/mobile-1.png" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="bb-slide-body">
          <span class="bb-slide-ix">01 / 07</span>
          <h3>Fate Chart</h3>
          <p>Answer Fate Questions with visible target numbers, Chaos Factor controls, and scene actions close by.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-slide" data-orient="wide">
        <div class="bb-slide-phone"><span class="bb-slide-platform">Desktop</span><img src="/v2/assets/desktop-1.png" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="bb-slide-body">
          <span class="bb-slide-ix">02 / 07</span>
          <h3>Fate Chart - Desktop</h3>
          <p>On desktop the Fate Chart has more room, with modifiers visible and Meaning Tables close at hand.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-slide" data-orient="tall">
        <div class="bb-slide-phone"><span class="bb-slide-platform">Mobile</span><img src="/v2/assets/mobile-2.png" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="bb-slide-body">
          <span class="bb-slide-ix">03 / 07</span>
          <h3>Scenes</h3>
          <p>Track scenes, check for interrupts or alterations, and keep the result connected to your Adventure Log.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-slide" data-orient="wide">
        <div class="bb-slide-phone"><span class="bb-slide-platform">Desktop</span><img src="/v2/assets/desktop-3.png" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="bb-slide-body">
          <span class="bb-slide-ix">04 / 07</span>
          <h3>Scenes - Desktop</h3>
          <p>Panels and split views give the Adventure Log, Fate Chart, and session notes room to sit side by side.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-slide" data-orient="tall">
        <div class="bb-slide-phone"><span class="bb-slide-platform">Mobile</span><img src="/v2/assets/mobile-4.png" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="bb-slide-body">
          <span class="bb-slide-ix">05 / 07</span>
          <h3>Dice Roller</h3>
          <p>Save the formulas you use most, including <code>2d6+1</code>, <code>d100</code>, and <code>4dF</code>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-slide" data-orient="wide">
        <div class="bb-slide-phone"><span class="bb-slide-platform">Desktop</span><img src="/v2/assets/desktop-5.png" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="bb-slide-body">
          <span class="bb-slide-ix">06 / 07</span>
          <h3>Threads - Desktop</h3>
          <p>Characters, Threads, Features, and Custom Tables can stay visible during longer sessions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-slide" data-orient="tall">
        <div class="bb-slide-phone"><span class="bb-slide-platform">Mobile</span><img src="/v2/assets/mobile-7.png" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="bb-slide-body">
          <span class="bb-slide-ix">07 / 07</span>
          <h3>Custom Tables</h3>
          <p>Create your own tables, import community tables, and export yours when you want to share or back them up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bb-controls">
        <button class="bb-ctrl" id="bbPrev" aria-label="Previous"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i></button>
        <button class="bb-ctrl" id="bbNext" aria-label="Next"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
